--- DEPENDENCIES & BUILD ARTIFACTS ---
Node.js dependencies
/node_modules
/services/*/node_modules
npm-debug.log
.npm

Lock files (unless you are strict about locking dependency versions)
package-lock.json
/services/*/package-lock.json

Yarn
yarn-error.log

Build outputs
/dist
/build
/out

--- ENVIRONMENT & CREDENTIALS ---
Environment variables (contains secrets, database passwords, etc.)
.env
/services//.env
.env.
.env.local

--- OPERATING SYSTEM FILES ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

--- DOCKER ---
Ignore Docker build context files
Docker volumes/data (if running locally and not inside the container's volume)
However, you might want to version Dockerfile and docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore files are important, but typically you do version them.
--- TESTING AND DEBUGGING ---
/coverage
.nyc_output
*.log

--- IDEs & EDITORS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace